      <data key="d2">"A household appliance used for storing food and beverages at cool temperatures."&lt;SEP&gt;The refrigerator is a large domestic appliance essential for storing food and beverages at low temperatures, thereby maintaining their freshness and longevity. It is commonly found in kitchens and boasts a light gray, modern design that features a sleek aesthetic, notably without visible handles. This design choice enhances its contemporary look, making it a favorable addition to modern home decor. Overall, the refrigerator serves a critical function in food storage while emphasizing a stylish and efficient appearance.</data>
