    <node id="Robotic Arm">
      <data key="d0">Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">appliance</data>
      <data key="d2">The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated and articulated mechanical device designed for automation and manipulation tasks, particularly within manufacturing and assembly environments. It features a distinctive blue and white color scheme, accented with tan and grey components, including a metallic structure and articulated joints. The arm includes a beige gripping mechanism and a tan end effector, which enable it to handle a diverse range of objects with precision.

Currently, the Robotic Arm is depicted reaching toward a stone-like object located to the right of a sofa, illustrating its ability to execute delicate movements and enhance interaction ease. It also demonstrates versatility by hovering above a cabinet, showcasing its skill in performing automated functions. Positioned on the right counter, the Robotic Arm serves as an effective tool for various tasks, significantly improving efficiency in automated settings.

Overall, this robotic device exemplifies advanced technology in robotic manipulation, highlighting its effectiveness in a wide array of functions such as moving and assisting with different objects.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"blue with white accents";"control;"extend;"grasp;"interact;"manipulate;"move;"navigate;"reach";assist";automate";control";extend";grasp;grasp";hover";interact";lift";manipulate;manipulate";move;move objects";move";navigate";observe;observe";pick_up;position;reach;reach";retract</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"avoid_overloading"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is described as being "partially visible," indicating that the complete details and functionalities of this device are not fully discernible from the available information. Currently, there are no additional specific characteristics or features provided about the robotic arm, which results in a limited overall understanding of this entity.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Robotic Arm is an advanced and versatile kitchen tool, recognizable by its striking blue and metallic design accented with white stripes. It is strategically positioned on the right side of the kitchen, hovering above a range of furniture, including a brown wooden cabinet, a wooden table, and a TV stand, while being oriented toward a sofa. This placement allows the Robotic Arm to seamlessly integrate into the domestic environment.

As an articulated and movable device, the Robotic Arm exhibits a wide array of motions that enhance its adaptability across diverse tasks. Currently, it is extending towards the right counter to prepare for the movement of a strawberry, effectively illustrating its utility in automating kitchen activities. The arm is programmed to pick up various objects and often interacts with utensils, including clamps, while being poised to engage with tools such as a knife and a spatula, though it has yet to commence these tasks.

Moreover, the Robotic Arm has demonstrated its interactive capabilities by hovering near the sink and engaging with a dark-colored object on the table. It is also noted for its position above the table, where it interacts with various objects for navigation and observation tasks. While it has not attempted to move a LEGO piece, its presence in the kitchen indicates a readiness for a variety of applications. Overall, the Robotic Arm is an integral and interactive technological fixture, prepared to enhance its surroundings' functionality and engage in multiple interactive scenarios while assisting users in performing tasks with precision. It is also notably aligned to the right of the sofa, aimed at interacting with a small yellow object.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is described as having a blue color with white accents and is located on the right side of the counter, near the sink.</data>
