    <node id="Sofa">
      <data key="d0">Sofa</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The sofa is a piece of furniture designed primarily for seating, typically upholstered and featuring a back and arms to enhance comfort. This particular sofa is arranged in an L-shape, characterized by a blocky design and rectangular cushions that embody both practicality and style. It is upholstered in a modern gray fabric, which adds a contemporary touch to its overall aesthetic. As a centrally positioned element in the living room, the gray sofa allows multiple people to sit comfortably, making it a popular choice in home furnishings. Overall, this gray sofa combines functionality with stylish design, making it a significant addition to any living space.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"interact;"sit;arrange";interact";lean;move";observe;observe";place;place items";rest;rest"</data>
