    <node id="Spatula">
      <data key="d0">Spatula</data>
      <data key="d1">utensil</data>
      <data key="d2">The spatula is a versatile and essential kitchen tool utilized for various culinary tasks, including mixing, spreading, lifting, and serving food. Typically characterized by its black color, it enables users to easily flip, serve, and transfer food items between locations, underscoring its significance in both home and professional kitchens. The multifunctionality of the spatula solidifies its status as a staple implement in cooking practices, making it an indispensable utensil in any cooking environment.</data>
