    <node id="Left Counter">
      <data key="d0">Left Counter</data>
      <data key="d1">surface</data>
      <data key="d2">"Darker surface containing fruits or vegetables"&lt;SEP&gt;The Left Counter is a prominent and functional horizontal surface located on the left side of the kitchen, typically positioned against a wall and opposite the right counter. It is characterized by a sleek matte dark finish, enhancing the kitchen's aesthetic appeal while serving as an essential workspace for food preparation. This versatile countertop accommodates various kitchen items, such as bowls of fruits and vegetables, thereby demonstrating its dual purpose as both a storage and preparation area.

Underneath the Left Counter, there are cabinets that contribute to maintaining a tidy and organized kitchen environment. Additionally, this counter features a unique receptacle for LEGO, expanding its utility beyond traditional culinary tasks. Notably, the sink is situated on the Left Counter, playing a central role in facilitating a variety of kitchen activities. Moreover, it is equipped to hold a receptacle for a spatula, which enhances practicality in daily kitchen operations. Overall, the Left Counter is integral to both the functionality and efficiency of the kitchen space.</data>
