      <data key="d1">tool</data>
      <data key="d2">The screwdriver is a hand-held tool specifically designed for driving screws. It features a metallic shaft and a handle, which allows for easy manipulation during use. This essential tool is widely recognized for its functionality and versatility across various tasks. Typically available in different colors, one notable option is a screwdriver with a blue handle. Overall, screwdrivers are indispensable tools utilized in a variety of applications to turn screws efficiently.</data>
