    <node id="User">
      <data key="d0">User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The User is an individual who actively engages with the kitchen environment, primarily focusing on updating spatial information. This participant or operator plays a crucial role in initiating various tasks that need to be performed within this specific setting. Furthermore, the User is involved in correcting their memory concerning the locations of specific objects, such as a bowl. As such, the User's responsibilities encompass both task initiation and the adjustment of their memory related to the surroundings in the kitchen.</data>
