      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">Lego is a type of plastic construction toy that consists of small building blocks, which are often used in both construction and creative play. These blocks come in various shapes and sizes, allowing for the building of intricate models and structures. They are designed to be manipulated and moved, fostering creativity and imaginative play among users.</data>
