      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Lego refers to a plastic building block that serves as the primary focus of a specific task. In this instance, the task involved attempting to move the Lego from the right counter to a left receptacle. Despite being the target object intended for relocation, the Lego was ultimately not found during the process. It is important to note that multiple descriptions confirm the Lego's role as the specific building block in question and emphasize that it was meant to be moved, but unfortunately, it could not be located.</data>
