      <data key="d11">48.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Task Request is a critical component that initiates the actions leading to a Perception Update. It serves to assess the environment prior to executing any actions. Specifically, this Task Request may involve monitoring the movements of both the strawberry and the robotic arm involved in the task, as well as making an observation update regarding the environment where an orange is sought. The Perception Update effectively incorporates any changes or findings related to the Task Request that must be completed, ensuring that pertinent observations about the environment are logged. In essence, the initiation of the task requires a Perception Update, which together with the Task Request, ensures that the actions taken are informed and responsive to the current state of the environment.</data>
